### ApiGatewayPay - peticiones de ejemplo (Visual Studio / VS Code REST Client)
### 1) Arranque: dotnet run --project src/ApiGatewayPay.Api
### 2) Código TOTP: pwsh ./tools/Get-Totp.ps1 -User maker@tenant-a
### 3) Pegue el access_token en @token. Contraseña de todos los usuarios de desarrollo: DevOnly-Sandbox-2026!

@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = PEGUE_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN
@otp = 000000

### Login con MFA (password + TOTP)
POST {{base}}/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username=maker%40tenant-a&password=DevOnly-Sandbox-2026!&otp={{otp}}

### Registrar beneficiario (requiere MFA reciente)
POST {{base}}/v1/beneficiaries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": "Proveedor SAS", "bankCode": "1007", "accountType": "savings", "accountNumber": "1234567890" }

### Crear pago (Idempotency-Key obligatoria)
POST {{base}}/v1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-pago-0000000001

{ "beneficiaryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "amountMinor": 15000000, "currency": "COP", "reference": "Factura 1001" }

### Listar pagos
GET {{base}}/v1/payments?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Saldo (alias opaco de la cuenta)
GET {{base}}/v1/accounts/ops-cop/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Salud
GET {{base}}/ready
